  lsblk

  mkfs.ext4 <partition_name>
  mount <partition_name> /mnt


  **to extend root volume partition**
  1. create instance
  2. modify volume --> increase size
  3. connect
  sudo su -
  lsblk
  growpart <partition_name>    ----> to grows the partition
  df -Th
  xfs_growfs / ----> to extend xfs filesystem   

  ext4:
  resize2fs     ----> to extend ext4 filesystem



